#
# ENG-3162 (2026-07-30): `external-secrets/kustomization.yaml` moves
# b483d9c0 -> 16e86a5c. my-idp-apps PR #24 changes that component from
# a one-field `replacements:` SOURCE into a strategic-merge `patches:`
# block that SUPPLIES the whole ExternalSecret CRD default set
