#
# ENG-3296 (2026-07-30): TWO NEW rows, `image-injection/image-ref.yaml`
# and `image-injection/kustomization.yaml` — the shared kustomize
# image-injection component (ENG-3154 T2/AC4), the ONE place a family
# image reference is stamped into a manifest. Every other row is
# byte-identical to the previous snapshot, verified by hashing every
# tracked components/** file in my-idp-apps PR #36's tree. Owner-mode
# COMPLETENESS is why this roster edit is not optional: a components/**
